 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n    <meta name=\"csrf-token\" content=\"1795679483:kNxYZ9O7GXo0MTH59i2u9HnycsKl9Y2Tvsx7NCcfB8c=\">\n    <meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\">\n    <script>\n        window.__feInitLocalTime = new Date().getTime() / 1000;\n        window.__feConfigVersion = '74d532c6c7861bfe'; window.__feConfigRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/config'; window.__fePhoneHomeCall = 'https\\u003A\\/\\/moshimoshi\\u003Aagltb3noatpwohhuenb5ag1tc2jsnnl3\\u0040errtrack.luogu.com.cn\\/lotlp1';        window.__luoguTagVersion = 'zh\\u002DCN\\/2026112514'; window.__luoguTagRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/tags';\n    </script>\n    <title>题解：P1012 [NOIP 1998 提高组] 拼数 - 洛谷专栏</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/favicon.ico\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline' luogu.com *.luogu.com luogu.com.cn *.luogu.com.cn luogu.org *.luogu.org wss: blob: luoguprivate.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com luogu.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.dun.163yun.com https://*.dun.163.com https://*.nosdn.126.net https://*.nosdn.127.net https://nos.netease.com https://cstaticdun.126.net https://cstaticdun1.126.net https://cstaticdun-v6.126.net https://acstatic-dun.126.net; img-src * data:; font-src * data:; worker-src data: blob:; frame-src https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn https://player.bilibili.com https://www.bilibili.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com\">\n        <script id=\"lentille-context\" type=\"application/json\">{\"instance\":\"main\",\"template\":\"article.show\",\"status\":200,\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"data\":{\"article\":{\"lid\":\"ngy7hblx\",\"title\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\\uff1aP1012 [NOIP 1998 \\u63d0\\u9ad8\\u7ec4] \\u62fc\\u6570\",\"category\":2,\"time\":1754699666,\"author\":{\"uid\":1218138,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/1218138.png\",\"name\":\"cd_afrder\",\"slogan\":\"\\u82e6\\u65c5\\u5c06\\u5c3d\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Green\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"\"},\"upvote\":0,\"replyCount\":0,\"favorCount\":0,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1012\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"[NOIP 1998 \\u63d0\\u9ad8\\u7ec4] \\u62fc\\u6570\",\"difficulty\":4,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":3,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"# \\u89e3\\u9898\\u601d\\u8def\\n\\u8f93\\u5165\\u65f6 \\uff0c\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u628a\\u8fd9 $n$ \\u4e2a\\u6570\\u5f53\\u6210\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\uff0c\\u7136\\u540e\\u7528 sort \\u6392\\u5e8f \\u3002\\n\\n**\\u4f46\\u662f\\uff01**\\n\\n\\u6211\\u4eec\\u5e76\\u4e0d\\u80fd\\u76f4\\u63a5\\u4f7f\\u7528 sort \\u5185\\u7f6e\\u7684\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u6bd4\\u8f83\\u51fd\\u6570\\uff0c\\u56e0\\u4e3a\\u5185\\u7f6e\\u51fd\\u6570\\u662f\\u6309\\u7167\\u7b80\\u5355\\u5b57\\u5178\\u5e8f\\u6765\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u6bd4\\u8f83\\u7684\\uff0c\\u6240\\u4ee5\\u5728\\u5904\\u7406\\u4e24\\u4e2a\\u957f\\u5ea6\\u4e0d\\u540c\\u7684\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u65f6\\u4f1a\\u51fa\\u9519\\u3002\\n\\n\\u4e3e\\u4e2a\\u4f8b\\u5b50\\uff1a\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32 $321$ \\u548c $37$ \\uff0c\\u5b57\\u5178\\u5e8f $351 \\u003E 32$\\uff0c\\u4f46\\u662f\\u5f88\\u660e\\u663e\\uff0c$32321 \\u003E 32114 $\\u3002\\n\\n\\u5176\\u6839\\u672c \\u539f\\u56e0\\u662f\\u5b57\\u5178\\u5e8f\\u53ea\\u662f\\u9010\\u4e2a\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u7684\\u6bd4\\u8f83 \\uff0c\\u800c\\u5ffd\\u7565\\u4e86\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u8fde\\u63a5\\u540e\\u6574\\u4e2a\\u6570\\u5b57\\u7684\\u8fdb\\u4f4d\\u3002\\n\\n\\u6240\\u4ee5\\uff0c\\u6211\\u4eec\\u5fc5\\u987b\\u624b\\u5199\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u6bd4\\u8f83\\u51fd\\u6570\\u3002\\n\\n\\u600e\\u4e48\\u5199\\u5462 \\uff1f\\n\\n\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u8fd9\\u4e48\\u5199 \\uff1a\\n```\\nbool cmp(string a,string b){\\n\\treturn (a+b)\\u003E(b+a);\\n}\\n```\\n\\n\\u90a3\\u5b83\\u4e3a\\u4ec0\\u4e48\\u6b63\\u786e\\u5462\\uff1f\\n\\n\\u6211\\u4eec\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u5047\\u8bbe\\u6700\\u4f18\\u7684\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u5e8f\\u5217\\u4e3a $s_1,s_2,s_3, \\\\dots ,s_n-1,s_n$\\u3002\\u90a3\\u4e48\\u8be5\\u5e8f\\u5217\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u4fdd\\u8bc1 $s_i + s_{i+1} \\u003E s_{i+1} + s_i$\\u3002\\n\\n\\u4e3a\\u5565\\u561e\\uff1f\\n\\n\\u82e5\\u5b58\\u5728 $s_i$ \\u548c $s_{i+1}$ \\u6ee1\\u8db3 ${s_{i+1} + s_i \\u003E s_i + s_{i+1}}$\\uff0c\\u90a3\\u4e48\\u65b0\\u5e8f\\u5217\\u7684\\u5b57\\u5178\\u5e8f\\u5c31\\u6bd4\\u201c\\u6700\\u4f18\\u5e8f\\u5217\\u201d\\u66f4\\u4f18\\u3002\\n\\n\\u8fd9\\u663e\\u7136\\u662f\\u77db\\u76fe\\u7684\\u3002\\n\\n\\u6240\\u4ee5\\u901a\\u8fc7\\u8fd9\\u6837\\u7684\\u53cd\\u8bc1\\u6cd5\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u8bc1\\u660e\\uff1a\\u6700\\u4f18\\u5e8f\\u5217\\u4e2d\\u4efb\\u610f\\u76f8\\u90bb\\u5bf9\\u5fc5\\u5b9a\\u6ee1\\u8db3 $s_i + s_{i+1} \\u003E s_{i+1} + s_i$\\u3002\\n\\n\\u90a3\\u4e48\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u5c31\\u5f88\\u7b80\\u5355\\u5566\\u3002\\n# \\u4ee3\\u7801\\u5949\\u4e0a\\n```\\n#include \\u003Cbits\\/stdc++.h\\u003E\\n\\nusing namespace std;\\n\\nconst int N=50;\\nint n;\\nstring s[N];\\nbool cmp(string a,string b){\\n\\treturn (a+b)\\u003E(b+a);\\n}\\nsigned main(){\\n\\tcin\\u003E\\u003En;\\n\\tfor(int i=1;i\\u003C=n;i++){\\n\\t\\tcin\\u003E\\u003Es[i];\\n\\t}\\n\\tsort(s+1,s+n+1,cmp);\\n\\tfor(int i=1;i\\u003C=n;i++){\\n\\t\\tcout\\u003C\\u003Cs[i];\\n\\t}\\n\\treturn 0;\\n}\\n```\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795593083.848419}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/ngy7hblx\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\\uff1aP1012 [NOIP 1998 \\u63d0\\u9ad8\\u7ec4] \\u62fc\\u6570\",\"description\":\"\\u89e3\\u9898\\u601d\\u8def\\n\\u8f93\\u5165\\u65f6 \\uff0c\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u628a\\u8fd9 n \\u4e2a\\u6570\\u5f53\\u6210\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\uff0c\\u7136\\u540e\\u7528 sort \\u6392\\u5e8f \\u3002\\n\\u4f46\\u662f\\uff01\\n\\u6211\\u4eec\\u5e76\\u4e0d\\u80fd\\u76f4\\u63a5\\u4f7f\\u7528 sort \\u5185\\u7f6e\\u7684\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u6bd4\\u8f83\\u51fd\\u6570\\uff0c\\u56e0\\u4e3a\\u5185\\u7f6e\\u51fd\\u6570\\u662f\\u6309\\u7167\\u7b80\\u5355\\u5b57\\u5178\\u5e8f\\u6765\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u6bd4\\u8f83\\u7684\\uff0c\\u6240\\u4ee5\\u5728\\u5904\\u7406\\u4e24\\u4e2a\\u957f\\u5ea6\\u4e0d\\u540c\\u7684\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u65f6\\u4f1a\\u51fa\\u9519\\u3002\\n\\u4e3e\\u4e2a\\u4f8b\\u5b50\\uff1a\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u4e32\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"cd_afrder\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-08-09T08:34:26+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"题解：P1012 [NOIP 1998 提高组] 拼数\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"解题思路\n输入时 ，可以把这 n 个数当成字符串，然后用 sort 排序 。\n但是！\n我们并不能直接使用 sort 内置的字符串比较函数，因为内置函数是按照简单字典序来进行比较的，所以在处理两个长度不同的字符串时会出错。\n举个例子：字符串…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"cd_afrder\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-08-09T08:34:26+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/ngy7hblx\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解：P1012 [NOIP 1998 提高组] 拼数</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">cd_afrder</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2025-08-09T08:34:26+08:00\">2025-08-09 08:34:26</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <h1>解题思路</h1>\n<p>输入时 ，可以把这 <la-tex display=\"inline\">n</la-tex> 个数当成字符串，然后用 sort 排序 。</p>\n<p><strong>但是！</strong></p>\n<p>我们并不能直接使用 sort 内置的字符串比较函数，因为内置函数是按照简单字典序来进行比较的，所以在处理两个长度不同的字符串时会出错。</p>\n<p>举个例子：字符串 <la-tex display=\"inline\">321</la-tex> 和 <la-tex display=\"inline\">37</la-tex> ，字典序 <la-tex display=\"inline\">351 &gt; 32</la-tex>，但是很明显，<la-tex display=\"inline\">32321 &gt; 32114 </la-tex>。</p>\n<p>其根本 原因是字典序只是逐个字符的比较 ，而忽略了字符串连接后整个数字的进位。</p>\n<p>所以，我们必须手写一个比较函数。</p>\n<p>怎么写呢 ？</p>\n<p>可以这么写 ：</p>\n<pre><code>bool cmp(string a,string b){\n    return (a+b)&gt;(b+a);\n}</code></pre>\n<p>那它为什么正确呢？</p>\n<p>我们可以假设最优的字符串序列为 <la-tex display=\"inline\">s_1,s_2,s_3, \\dots ,s_n-1,s_n</la-tex>。那么该序列可以保证 <la-tex display=\"inline\">s_i + s_{i+1} &gt; s_{i+1} + s_i</la-tex>。</p>\n<p>为啥嘞？</p>\n<p>若存在 <la-tex display=\"inline\">s_i</la-tex> 和 <la-tex display=\"inline\">s_{i+1}</la-tex> 满足 <la-tex display=\"inline\">{s_{i+1} + s_i &gt; s_i + s_{i+1}}</la-tex>，那么新序列的字典序就比“最优序列”更优。</p>\n<p>这显然是矛盾的。</p>\n<p>所以通过这样的反证法可以证明：最优序列中任意相邻对必定满足 <la-tex display=\"inline\">s_i + s_{i+1} &gt; s_{i+1} + s_i</la-tex>。</p>\n<p>那么代码就很简单啦。</p>\n<h1>代码奉上</h1>\n<pre><code>#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst int N=50;\nint n;\nstring s[N];\nbool cmp(string a,string b){\n    return (a+b)&gt;(b+a);\n}\nsigned main(){\n    cin&gt;&gt;n;\n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++){\n        cin&gt;&gt;s[i];\n    }\n    sort(s+1,s+n+1,cmp);\n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++){\n        cout&lt;&lt;s[i];\n    }\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a5ff11652e34f29d',t:'MTc5NTU5MzA4Mw=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a5ff11652e34f29d',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
